    },
    "Scrobbles go through your server, so one connection covers all your devices. Plays made offline are sent later. If your Navidrome is also linked to Last.fm, a play may be counted twice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrobble'id lähevad läbi sinu serveri, nii et üks ühendus katab kõik sinu seadmed. Võrguta kuulatud lood saadetakse hiljem. Kui sinu Navidrome on samuti Last.fm-iga seotud, võidakse üks kuulamine lugeda kaks korda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimekirjad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show BPM in song lists": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Näita lugude nimekirjades BPM-i"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look up lyrics online (LRCLIB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otsi sõnu internetist (LRCLIB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Playback quality": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esituskvaliteet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi and wired use the Wi-Fi profile; cellular and iOS Low Data Mode use the Cellular one. Transcoding is done by your Navidrome server. A song already on the phone plays as it is. On cellular nothing is downloaded in the background unless you allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi ja juhtmega ühendus kasutavad Wi-Fi profiili; mobiilne ühendus ja iOS-i andmesäästurežiim kasutavad mobiilset profiili. Teisendamise teeb sinu Navidrome'i server. Telefonis juba olev lugu mängib nii, nagu ta on. Mobiilis ei laeta taustal midagi alla, kui sa seda ei luba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vahemälu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tracks are downloaded in the background — the next one right away — so they start instantly and play without a network. The oldest files are removed when the limit is reached; songs you keep offline are never removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lood laetakse taustal alla (järgmine kohe), nii et need algavad kohe ja mängivad ka ilma võrguta. Limiidi täitumisel eemaldatakse vanimad failid; võrguta hoitud lugusid ei eemaldata kunagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logi välja"
          }
        }
      }
